Harmony and wellness need a pure, clean, healthy environment. Excess acidic wastes are the underlying cause of degenerative diseases such as diabetes, arthritis, fibromyalgia, rheumatoid arthritis, neurological disorders, and cancer, in fact,[ all other] diseases.
