=== Text #4 ===
> Foil plaid lycra and spandex shortall with metallic slinky insets. Attached metallic elastic belt with O-ring. Headband included. Great hip hop or jazz dance costume. Made in the USA.[][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]

=== Text #5 ===
> evil chef mom: Pulp Muppets!
My two favorite things... Pulp Fiction and The Muppets.
that is hilarious. i gotta show k this when he gets home from work![][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]

=== Text #6 ===
> Watch out for snakes. I also love how the OG's still sneak in and MJP looks AMAZING!!![][][][]

=== Text #7 ===
> J Brand can do no wrong! They always have such beautiful pieces that belong in every women closet. I just wished my wallet agreed with me 😋 Lol![][][][][][][][][][][]

=== Text #8 ===
> What does Oxypoda grandipennis mean as a name of something?
Oxypoda grandipennis is a species of Oxypoda, described by Casey in 1911.
