=== Text #9 ===
> Six (6) White Rose Pomander Kissing Balls with green leaves. Hangs from a white mesh ribbon. Looks great with any d?cor. Approx. 8 inches. Great condition, only used once for my wedding ceremony.[][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]

